                <h1 class="hero-name">Sumit Kumar Keshari</h1>
                <p class="hero-title">.NET Software Engineer &amp; Backend Developer</p>
                <p class="hero-description">
                    Dedicated Software Engineer with extensive experience in the .NET framework, ASP.NET Core, and WPF. Currently migrating enterprise web apps to Blazor WebAssembly and actively developing cross-platform mobile applications using Flutter.
                </p>

                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-primary" aria-label="View my projects">
                        View My Work
