                <p class="about-bio">
                    Hi! I'm Sumit, a passionate .NET Software Engineer with a solid background in developing robust web and desktop applications. I specialize in C#, ASP.NET Core, and WPF, and I am currently expanding my expertise by migrating traditional .NET projects to modern Blazor WebAssembly architectures, alongside building cross-platform mobile apps with Flutter.
